'''Royal Submariner''' (海底財宝発掘命令, ''Kaitei Zaihō Hakkutsu Meirei'', '''Undersea Treasure Excavation Order''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 5.8 Update|Version 5.8]].

==Effect==
Worker Cat Start Level UP (Sm): Worker Cat's initial level starts with +1.

